<ul>
<li>Everyone grew his own corn.</li>
<li>When there was a need, people shared with one another.</li>
<li>Their grain was larger and yielded more flour than present-day grain.</li>
<li>He had heard his father say that in his time grain grew larger and yielded more flour than theirs.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="card">
