<p>Why does the grandson walk with two crutches, the son with one, while the grandfather has none and has bright eyes, sound teeth and clear speech?</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="visual">
<div class="flow">
<div class="node">People’s way of living</div><div class="arrow">→</div>
<div class="node">Own labour vs. dependence on others’ labour</div><div class="arrow">→</div>
<div class="node">Difference between generations</div>
</div>
